# ── Blueprints — sources AND PDFs are tracked ────────────────────────────────
# Previously only 12 customer-facing PDFs were tracked and every markdown source was
# local-only. The predictable result: sources drifted months behind the code with no
# reviewable diff — voice_cloning_pipeline.md still described an extra that had gained
# three dependencies and an AppImage bundling it never mentioned, and the shipped
# manual sent users to a Settings page that does not exist. Tracking the sources is
# what makes that visible in review; 39 markdown files are 564K and 29 more PDFs 3.4M.
# Icons and other blueprint assets stay local.
blueprints/*
!blueprints/*.pdf
!blueprints/*.md

