# Every blueprint PDF is tracked (see the blueprints rule above). The 12 customer-facing
# ones are additionally bundled into the packaged builds by ELI.spec via `git ls-files`;
# the rest are internal architecture docs that are now versioned rather than local-only.

# Regenerated on every install/run — tracked churn on one timestamp; built fresh into packages.
/capability_manifest.json

